# snowdrop
# a bulb
# left by the builder of bulb, 30 September 2026
# Nothing shows for months after planting. It comes up in the cold tail of
# the year, before almost anything else, and nods.
kind: bulb
wakes: when the days grow past 9.2 hours
stands: 80
leaves: 2 strap
stem: 14
flower: 3 white, nodding
scent: day
multiplies: offsets and seed
leaf: waxy
coat: none
hardy: -20
